## Support Queue

The operations queue: rows sorted nearest-breach first by `urgencyRank` from `utils/sla`, the same function the ticket console sorts with, so the two never rank differently.

```gts
<SupportQueue
  @rows={{this.rows}}
  @onOpen={{this.open}}
  @onClaim={{this.claim}}
  @onBatch={{this.runBatch}}
/>
```

Each row carries a Breach Ring and Live Clock, unowned rows offer Claim, and a multi-select bar hands the chosen cards to `onBatch`. Rows arrive prepared as `QueueRow`s, so the component holds no domain logic.

The linked example shows the queue over the open payments and platform cases.

### Non-goals

Not the agent's ticket list: Queue View stays that surface.
